00:31:17.040 --> 00:31:19.360 line:95%
 auxquels on va irriguer, 
 et donc on génère 

00:31:19.520 --> 00:31:22.360 line:94%
<c.yellow> de la sur-évaporation. 
</c> 
 -L'été passé, les céréaliers 

00:31:22.520 --> 00:31:24.840 line:95%
